        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": "Codes to reproduce the results of the commentary to Silini et al. 2021, \"Incorrect computation of Madden-Julian oscillation prediction skill\" by Suematsu, T., et al. Execuation of this program requires the Real-time multivariate MJO index (Wheeler and Hendon 2004) from Australian Government Bureau of Meteorology (http://www.bom.gov.au/climate/mjo/)  and Keras TensorFlow trained feed-forward neural network, which can be found at GitHub repository of https://github.com/riccardosilini/MJO-prediction-networks. ",
